@PerformanceBenchmark_HostAddress = http://localhost:5144

### 1. Get Available Benchmarks
GET {{PerformanceBenchmark_HostAddress}}/api/benchmarks
Accept: application/json

### 2. Run JSON Serialization Benchmark (System.Text.Json vs Newtonsoft.Json)
POST {{PerformanceBenchmark_HostAddress}}/api/benchmarks/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "benchmarkId": "json",
  "iterations": 5000
}

### 3. Run String Concatenation Benchmark (+ vs StringBuilder vs Interpolation)
POST {{PerformanceBenchmark_HostAddress}}/api/benchmarks/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "benchmarkId": "string",
  "iterations": 10000
}

### 4. Run Collection Iteration Benchmark (For vs Foreach vs LINQ)
POST {{PerformanceBenchmark_HostAddress}}/api/benchmarks/run
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "benchmarkId": "collection",
  "iterations": 2000
}
